["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どこ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哪里；什么地方；多长；多远；到什么程度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232489\">あなたはどこでテレビを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Where do you watch television?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どこか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某处；某地；在某些方面；在某种程度上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201044\">どこかおかしいと<ruby>一目<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはわかりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I could tell at a glance that something was wrong.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土産</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">土产；当地特产；礼物；纪念品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土台</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">基础；地基；根基；从一开始；本来；本质上</span></div><div clas