190\"><ruby>学童<rp>(</rp><rt>がくどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはどっと<ruby>笑<rp>(</rp><rt>わら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The pupils burst out laughing.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">堤坝；河堤；堤岸；牛筋味噌烧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186590\"><ruby>花々<rp>(</rp><rt>はなばな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>土手<rp>(</rp><rt>どて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>咲<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Blossoms have come out on the embankment.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どなた</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谁；哪位</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"4914\">「どなたですか」「お<ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>かあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんよ」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;Who is it?&quot; &quot;It&#x27;s your mother.&quot;</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どなる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">(愤怒地)大喊；大声吼叫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182397\"><ruby>泣<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>怒鳴<rp>(</rp><rt>どな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るな。<ruby>火<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>油<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だから。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t shout at the crying child. It only adds fuel to the fire.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">どの</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哪个；哪种</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218528\">これはほかのどの<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりも<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This is taller than any other tree.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土俵</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どひょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（相扑）土俵；摔跤场；（讨论等的）场所；舞台；沙袋；土工袋；石笼</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土木</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どぼく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">土木工程；土建工程；公共工程</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土曜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">星期六；周六</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124484\"><ruby>土曜<rp>(</rp><rt>どよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Do you go to school on Saturday?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土曜日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どようび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">星期六</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">土</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドライ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干燥的；干的；（语气、幽默等）冷淡的；无感情的；不动声色的；公事公办的；务实的；（酒）不甜的；干型的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118958\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはドライなユーモアはわかりませんよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He doesn&#x27;t have a dry sense of humor.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドライクリーニング</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干洗；干洗服务</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204000\">タールがどうしても<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちない。このスカートはドライクリーニングに<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さなきゃならないだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The tar won&#x27;t come off. I&#x27;m going to have to take this skirt to the dry cleaner.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドライバー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">驾驶员；司机；螺丝刀；起子；一号木杆；开球木杆；（设备）驱动程序</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74962\">このドライバーは<ruby>小<rp>(</rp><rt>ちい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さすぎて<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This screwdriver is too small to be any use.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドライブ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">兜风；驾车旅行；驾驶；（去）兜风；开车出游；驾驶（汽车等）；推动；驱动（创新、变革等）；（计算机）驱动器；磁盘驱动器</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199759\">ドライブするのはどうですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How about going for a drive?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ドライブイン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">免下车服务设施（银行、电影院等）；路边餐厅；休息站</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184639\"><ruby>街道<rp>(</rp><rt>かいどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>沿<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのドライブインで<ruby>昼食<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We had lunch at a roadside restaurant.</spa